lish the original question's financial target with source-anchored algebra, not just coincidentally match its number. Alternative arithmetic grouping is permitted. Unsupported alternative evidence equivalences can remain outside this bounded oracle.\"},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request.v2\",\"state\":{\"action_count\":4,\"claims\":[{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:592006198cd025393505ec189d9df6268f5ab9ee862942a1e344c016053c1092\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"4648\",\"expression\":\"source:t11c1n0\",\"financial_target_certified\":false,\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim:7e37392cfa26e586b719d86837d3bf2ca811675ca94fb0c8d70fdde3cc2fe533\",\"lineage\":[\"source:t11c1n0\"],\"observation_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_observation:82e0e12a151df7757d5a0039129752f58b3cb7b3c28693734d2ee6e2a40a2514\",\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim.v2\",\"session_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_finqa_registration:4a5e82c66ad8cdec1772c104e279877233a8aacb23940c2e2afc8bd75ff2b72c\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"value\":\"4648\"},{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:f1e285076e51b7c8032af68ea651930c9b53ed5acd41af8eac2bfc81c35a17b5\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"3625\",\"expression\":\"source:t11c2n0\",\"financial_target_certified\":false,\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim:4124bdb9647f4d14147eb4d2d028541a32bda3adedf3e20286a04acb8591a96a\",\"lineage\":[\"source:t11c2n0\"],\"observation_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_observation:521bea320ba321c0ea2219347ad08d8a19031dcbec4202c7982b6b664a83db5b\",\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim.v2\",\"session_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_finqa_registration:4a5e82c66ad8cdec1772c104e279877233a8aacb23940c2e2afc8bd75ff2b72c\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"value\":\"3625\"},{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:dd15e03d0394423b6dc5679d6871e277154d0aee98ea1ea94d5b6d24d4b0b1b9\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"1620\",\"exp